OL,11,     Fon the operating table!
OL,12,G0210 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,13,     FShona performs hi-tech laser
OL,14,     Fsurgery on a pony. Peter rushes to
OL,15,     Fsee a newborn calf that has
OL,16,     Fsomehow suffered a very nasty cut.
OL,17,     FJulian meets a large, rather
OL,18,     Fintimidating Belgian Hare.
